{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"荃灣單位起火　無人傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-21-07-21-23pyQFATOm.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】荃灣清晨有單位起火，無人受傷。</p><p>警方及消防員到場，協助約一百名住戶疏散到地下。</p><p>警方清晨5時許接報，荃灣青山公路623號樓上一個單位起火。消防派出煙帽隊開喉灌救，約40分鐘後將火救熄。火警中無人受傷，起火原因有待調查。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T23:56:07.299704+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T23:19:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T23:49:38.685864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T23:49:38.685864+00:00","content_hash":"a102e0c4040de77ccfb657e2f86d0937829d0178b59d35df195bd349bb35fee2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}